    {
      "id": "current-route-role",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Current Route Role",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Diamora sits on Whakapanu Island as part of the Act 4 island route. Whether she is mandatory depends on the current league objective, but she is the gate to the Shoreline Hideout and a strong optional target.",
        "Her loot and the hideout unlock make her worth the petrification risk even when the main quest does not force the fight."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Act 4 island boss, not a main-quest gate.",
        "Unlocks the Shoreline Hideout on defeat.",
        "Value: hideout + island loot."
      ]
    },
