    {
      "id": "gaze-and-mirror-guide",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Gaze and Mirror Guide",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 5,
      "paragraphs": [
        "During the petrification phase Diamora's face and several mirrors emit a gaze beam. Looking at her face OR a lit mirror stacks petrification on you. Turning your camera away (or breaking line of sight) reduces the stack.",
        "The safe play is to keep her out of your view during the gaze: reposition so a pillar or wall blocks the beam, or simply look away while dodging."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Boss face + mirrors both petrify.",
        "Turn camera away or break LoS to drop stacks.",
        "One petrify phase since 0.5.2 — do not expect repeats."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "arena-state",
      "type": "arena",
      "title": "Arena and Hazards",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 6,
      "paragraphs": [
        "The Singing Caverns arena has Water Geysers that erupt in patterns and Drowning Orbs that restrict movement. During the petrification phase, mirrors around the edge reflect her gaze.",
        "Use the pillars for line-of-sight breaks during the gaze, and keep mobile to avoid geyser and orb coverage."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Water Geysers: erupt in readable patterns, dodge the columns.",
        "Drowning Orbs: limit space, keep moving.",
        "Mirrors: reflect gaze, use pillars to break LoS."
      ]
    },
