    {
      "id": "visibility-guide",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Visibility Guide",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 8,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Petrification is a visibility mechanic: you can still act, but the screen effect and stack warn you. The fix is camera discipline, not a stat.",
        "If the effect spikes, immediately break line of sight. Pillars in the Singing Caverns are your friend during the gaze."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Gaze is camera-based, not resistance-based.",
        "Break LoS with pillars during the gaze.",
        "Stacks drop when you look away."
      ]
    },
