      "type": "build-considerations",
      "title": "Build Considerations",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 10,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Diamora is less about stats and more about mechanics. Any build can clear her if it respects the gaze and keeps mobile for geysers and orbs.",
        "Melee has short windows because she dives; ranged can pressure during surfacings but must still break LoS for the gaze."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Melee: burst on resurface, respect dive.",
        "Ranged: pressure surfacings, break LoS for gaze.",
